__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.hydra/
outputs/
# Ignore data/ contents, but keep a couple of small tracked files. git does not
# descend into an excluded DIRECTORY, so each path component has to be
# re-included explicitly -- hence `data/*` rather than `data/`.
data/*
!data/README.md
# A/B split provenance (scene floor spans + the sampled episode ids): a few KB,
# and the record of how configs/eval/dev50*.yaml were produced.
!data/splits/
data/splits/*
!data/splits/*.json
.env
*.npz
*.pt
mobileclip_blt.ts
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude
# The ASCENT reference implementation (arXiv 2505.23019) is a CHECKOUT of an
# external project with its own .git, kept here to read against -- every
# `relative_work/ascent/...:NNN` citation in docs/AB_RESULTS.md points into it.
# It is not part of this package and is not ours to vendor.
relative_work/
